2. **Reaction with Ammoniacal Silver Nitrate:**
   - The reaction of 'B' with ammoniacal silver nitrate (AgNO₃/ NH₃) forms a silver mirror. This is the Tollens' test, which is a positive test for aldehydes.
   - The reaction is:
     \[
     \text{R-CHO} + \text{AgNO}_3 \xrightarrow{\text{NH}_3} \text{R-CHO} \xrightarrow{\text{AgO}} \text{Ag} + \text{H}_2\text{O}
     \]
