   ΔH_comb(CH3COOH) = -166.5 kJ/mol

Now, we can use Hess's Law to calculate the standard enthalpy of formation for ethanoic acid (CH3COOH):

ΔHf(CH3COOH) = -ΔHc(CH3COOH)

