","To determine the geometric mean of the soil-to-polished root tissue transfer factor (F) for \(^{133}\text{Cs}\), we need to know the actual values of the transfer factor (TF) for \(^{133}\\text{Cs}\) in soil to polished root tissue. The geometric mean is calculated as the geometric mean of the values of the transfer factor (F) for \(^{133}\text{Cs}\) in soil to polished root tissue. The geometric mean is calculated as:  
